rop bits: bits = d | s, applied once per fragment (s what a fragment brings, d the cell's value)
  order: the result does not depend on the order of the fragments: bits(s2, bits(s1, d)) = bits(s1, bits(s2, d)) (proved by SAT)
  fixed-function states that compute it (each a proposal: the pipeline changes):
  logic op: VK_LOGIC_OP_OR on an unsigned integer target (R32_UINT): s | d
